sentences.text:
The above mentioned two appeals are preferred against award dated 06.04.2019 passed in the claim petitions filed under Sections 166 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 by the learned Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Ludhiana (for 1 of 13 117 FAO-4907 and 4841-2019 short, 'the Tribunal'),
for enhancement of compensation granted to the claimants to the tune of Rs.66,15,112/- along with interest @7.5% per annum, on account of death of Avtar Singh in a Motor Vehicular Accident,
occurred on 06.05.2017.
